	<string name="onboarding_welcome_heading">Welcome to StickerBoard</string>
	<string name="onboarding_welcome_text">StickerBoard is a keyboard for sending your own stickers, GIFs and short videos in any app. Let\'s get you set up in two quick steps.</string>
	<string name="onboarding_keyboard_heading">Enable the Keyboard</string>
	<string name="onboarding_keyboard_text">"StickerBoard works as a keyboard, so Android needs your permission before it can be used.

Tap the button below to open your keyboard settings, then switch on \"StickerBoard\". You can come back here once it\'s enabled."</string>
	<string name="onboarding_folder_heading">Choose Your Stickers</string>
	<string name="onboarding_folder_text">"StickerBoard loads its stickers, GIFs and videos from a folder you choose on your device, with each sub-folder becoming a sticker pack.

